Z||000002||Roy Grooms||08-22-2001||09:05 PM|||| YES,I went with red oad veneer and used contact cement to glue it to a old face plate<BR> the oak veneer was a real; pain to cut,razor knife stainless steel blades. and a sharp small chisel for the small squares. sorry i don't have any pic. scanner is down<BR>one of these days i'll get a new one<BR>    if you deside to do this , TAKE YOUR TIME<BR> and it should come out great, mine did<BR>          Roys /toy||||reg||1
